<translate>
==== ProtectFromRainWhenEquipped ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If this parameter is true, then the player is protected from rain if the item is equipped.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ProtectFromRainWhenEquipped = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

